# Copy to ./stripe-secret.env and fill in the value (that file is gitignored;
# this example stays committed). Used only by scripts/stripe/syncStripe.mjs.
#
# Where to get it: Stripe dashboard (TEST mode) → Developers → API keys →
# secret key. The sk_live_ flip at launch (docs/store-integration.md
# §2.6 step 6) provides the LIVE key under the same env key name:
#
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_…
#
# and the scripts take it with --live (a sk_live_ key is refused without
# it — sandbox stays the default).
#
# env STRIPE_SECRET_KEY always wins over this file. Never paste the key into
# git, chat, or the VPS logs.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
